hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"15940","Abu Mu'awiya narrated to us, from Hisham ibn Urwa, from his father, from Hisham ibn Hakim ibn Hizam, he said: He passed by people being punished for jizya in Filastin. He said: So he said: I heard the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) say: Allah the Mighty and Majestic will punish on the Day of Resurrection those who punish people in this world."
